"Connected on another device." = "已在其他设备连接";
"The connection was lost." = "连接已断开。";
"Something went wrong." = "出了点问题。";
"Can't reach the computer. Check the address and that remote connections are allowed in Vhostty there." = "无法连接到电脑。请检查地址，并确认那台电脑的 Vhostty 已允许远程连接。";
